- [`legal/TRADEMARKS.md`](legal/TRADEMARKS.md) — naming rules (referenced in §3.7)
- [`legal/TRUST_FRAMEWORK.md`](legal/TRUST_FRAMEWORK.md) — Perpetual Purpose Trust plan (referenced in §15)
