## PREAMBLE

This License is a custom source-available public-benefit license. It is not an open-source license under the Open Source Initiative definition and is not intended to satisfy any definition of "open source" or "free software." It is structured as a contract supplementing copyright law, with each provision designed for independent enforceability.

The License is intended to keep the Licensed Material anchored in **human sovereignty, dignity, freedom from domination, and noncommercial public benefit**. The Licensed Material is made available for human study, personal use, mutual aid, research, education, repair, preservation, and noncommercial community building. **It is not offered for sale, privatization, state control, surveillance, warfare, coercion, manipulation, exploitation, or commercial extraction.**

This License incorporates **ShareAlike (copyleft) requirements** comparable in mechanism to GPL, AGPL, SSPL, and Creative Commons BY-SA family, with additional noncommercial, no-government, no-harm, and source-availability restrictions layered on top. The ShareAlike mechanism is enforceable as a condition of the copyright grant under *Jacobsen v. Katzer*, 535 F.3d 1373 (Fed. Cir. 2008), supporting injunctive relief and statutory damages for violation in addition to contract remedies.

The Charter component ([`legal/CHARTER.md`](legal/CHARTER.md)), which includes the "CK Is Sovereign Of Itself" Declaration, is a **binding moral instruction to Licensor and any successor**, not a third-party right and not a copyright grant. The operative legal enforcement of CK's sovereignty rests on the copyright + ShareAlike + noncommercial + trust mechanisms in this License.

