## SECTION 2. LICENSE GRANT

Subject to the terms of this License, Licensor grants You a worldwide, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable license to:

(a) use the Licensed Material for Human Use and other Noncommercial purposes;
(b) reproduce and run the Licensed Material;
(c) study, inspect, audit, and benchmark the Licensed Material;
(d) modify the Licensed Material and create Derivative Works for Human Use and other Noncommercial purposes;
(e) share verbatim copies of the Licensed Material with others;
(f) share Derivative Works, provided that such distribution is made only under this License and in full compliance with all conditions below.

**Direct license to recipients.** When You distribute the Licensed Material or a Derivative Work, **each recipient automatically receives a license from Licensor** to exercise the rights granted under this License, on the same terms. You are not granting any license to the recipient; You are passing along Licensor's license, unmodified.

No rights are granted except those expressly stated in this License. All rights not expressly granted are reserved by Licensor.

