(c) terminates automatically upon Your violation of Sections 3.2, 3.3, 3.4, or any provision of [`legal/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md`](legal/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md);
(d) does not authorize any use prohibited by this License regardless of patent status.

