## SECTION 14. GOVERNING LAW AND VENUE

**14.1 Governing law.** This License is governed by the laws of the State of Arkansas, excluding its conflict-of-laws rules.

**14.2 Venue.** Any dispute arising under this License shall be brought exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Clark County, Arkansas.

**14.3 Equitable relief.** Licensor is entitled to seek injunctive relief and specific performance in addition to monetary damages for any violation of Sections 3.2, 3.3, 3.4, 3.5, 3.6, or [`legal/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md`](legal/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md).

**14.4 No class arbitration.** Disputes under this License shall not be subject to class arbitration.

**14.5 Statute of limitations.** Claims for violation of Section 3.2, 3.3, 3.4, or [`legal/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md`](legal/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md) may be brought within ten (10) years of the date Licensor first becomes aware of the violation.

